    "speaker_class": "",
    "speaker_faction": "",
    "speaker_cell": "",
    "player_faction": "",
    "sound_path": "",
    "text": "Giron Manas denies ever having been to the Beran Ancestral Tomb.",
    "filters": [],
    "script_text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "DialogueInfo",
    "flags": "",
    "id": "116878752915293170219345303689",
    "prev_id": "278660501717499224058658169726",
    "next_id": "139725257210951613905750686399",
    "data": {
      "dialogue_type": "Journal",
      "disposition": 30,
      "speaker_rank": -1,
      "speaker_sex": "Any",
      "player_rank": -1
    },
    "speaker_id": "",
    "speaker_race": "",
    "speaker_class": "",
    "speaker_faction": "",
    "speaker_cell": "",
    "player_faction": "",
    "sound_path": "",
    "text": "I confronted Giron Manas with the bloodied journal I found in Beran Ancestral Tomb. He confessed to guiding the high elf into the tomb and taking an obsidian orb that was hidden there. He sold the orb in town.",
    "filters": [],
    "script_text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "DialogueInfo",
    "flags": "",
    "id": "139725257210951613905750686399",
    "prev_id": "116878752915293170219345303689",
    "next_id": "10417530154207704503686569378",
    "data": {
      "dialogue_type": "Journal",
      "disposition": 40,
      "speaker_rank": -1,
      "speaker_sex": "Any",
      "player_rank": -1
    },
    "speaker_id": "",
    "speaker_race": "",
    "speaker_class": "",
    "speaker_faction": "",
    "speaker_cell": "",
    "player_faction": "",
    "sound_path": "",
    "text": "Fadase Selvayn bought the orb, and said he later sold it to Barnand Erelie.",
    "filters": [],
    "script_text": ""
  },
  {
    "type": "DialogueInfo",
    "flags": "",
    "id": "10417530154207704503686569378",
    "prev_id": "139725257210951613905750686399",
    "next_id": "347226473410042067615172606741",
    "data": {
      "dialogue_type": "Journal",
      "disposition": 50,
      "speaker_rank": -1,
      "speaker_sex": "Any",
      "player_rank": -1
    },
